{"id": "api-student-orders-list-shape-001", "type": "api_behavior", "fact": "GET /student/orders returns the Order schema only — {id, status, total_amount, placed_at}. Line items, fulfilment_type and the pickup OTP live on OrderDetail, returned by the single-order endpoint. The list response carries no item names, no quantities and no image.", "recommendation": "An order card in the My Orders list can show status, total and date and nothing more. Do not design a list row that needs item lines or an OTP — it would require an N+1 fetch per order. See mobile/src/api/generated/008-my-orders-history-upcoming.d.ts for the authoritative shape.", "confidence": "high", "provenance": [{"source": "agent", "reference": "specs/017-ui-refresh self-reflect", "date": "2026-11-06"}], "tags": ["api", "orders", "mobile", "ui-constraints"], "affectedFiles": ["mobile/src/screens/student/MyOrdersScreen.tsx", "mobile/src/api/generated/008-my-orders-history-upcoming.d.ts"], "affectedServices": [], "createdAt": "2026-11-06T00:00:00Z", "updatedAt": "2026-11-06T00:00:00Z", "usageCount": 0, "helpfulCount": 0, "outdatedReports": 0}
